D host-wide, no partial/full upgrade or service restart. This seat's narrower NO-EXEC/NO-FETCH scope forbids installations.\nThree receipt prefixes exactly once, unfenced, no extra punctuation; indent examples. Renderer Lane bounds line is informational, not a fourth receipt field. If blocked by undeclared path/tool, report the gap without improvising.\n",
